{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y部分段落的感受词和意象过于密集，且S12、S13有补充或改写人物动机的情况，削弱了原有心理因果的准确性。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮短语让观众扫屏时迅速抓住情节支点，按音乐小节出现的感受词又避免了所有信息同时堆在屏幕上，水波、小船、声线等反复出现的意象也增强了前后连贯性，感受比X更细腻具体。X的完整叙述在人物动机和因果解释上更稳，尤其S13对他为什么想收回心意、为什么又收不回去的解释更准确清楚。总体而言Y更像一边听音乐一边能自然接收到的体验，但需要控制少数段落的意象堆叠和心理改写。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8c9c63f5-e60b-45fb-800d-4a0b86f7ad7b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T011330033343Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.343, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:14:36.391186+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "25bcf65581270b5a8b31f82751e6fdeb0d81ca0ebd9b20daaa3b71e89f3deadf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w